								<br />
								<br />
								Stop falling into the subscription trap of paying monthly rent just to host your own properties. By joining
								Andalucía’s first free Smart MLS and CRM ecosystem, you gain instant access to a collaborative grid of verified
								agencies and thousands of shared properties.
								<br />
								<br />
								Unlike legacy portals, we treat the core infrastructure as a free public utility. You operate on a flexible
								“Pay-As-You-Go” model, only investing in advanced AI tools - like our CMA Property Research Agent or the Google
								Gemini-powered Renovation Agent - when you have a specific deal to unblock. Maximise your ROI, eliminate fixed
								overheads, and close deals faster.
						</div>
						<div class="personaLinks">
							<a href="/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/">MLS &amp; CRM User Guide</a>
							<a href="/docs/laws-procedures/">Laws &amp; Procedures</a>
							<a href="/neighbourhood/">Area Guides</a>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class={`personaPanel ${persona === 'developers' ? 'isActive' : ''}`} data-persona-panel="developers">
							<div class="personaTitle">For Developers</div>
						<div class="personaSummary">
								PropertyList transforms developers from Speculative Advertisers into Strategic Distributors.
								<br />
								<br />
								Stop burning your marketing budget on upfront exposure that guarantees nothing. Instead, instantly place your
								entire new build portfolio into the hands of a massive, active sales force of verified estate agents.
								<br />
								<br />
								Unlike traditional advertising platforms, listing your new developments on PropertyList is completely free.
								Your portfolio becomes shared inventory within our high-speed network. You only pay the performance-based
								commission that you set when an agent actually secures a buyer. Every euro spent is tied directly to a confirmed
								sale, meaning zero wasted marketing spend.
						</div>
						<div class="personaLinks">
							<a href="https://info.propertylist.es/developers#get-updates">How it works?</a>
							<a href="/docs/developers/">Developers Docs</a>
