					<div class={`personaPanel ${persona === 'services' ? 'isActive' : ''}`} data-persona-panel="services">
							<div class="personaTitle">For Property Services</div>
						<div class="personaSummary">
								PropertyList elevates Architects, Lawyers, and Builders from Cold Advertisers into Contextual Strategic
								Solutions.
								<br />
								<br />
								Stop wasting budget interrupting people with generic directory ads. Our platform embeds your services directly
								into the daily workflow of active real estate professionals exactly when a transaction requires your expertise.
								<br />
								<br />
								Leveraging Contextual AI - such as our Renovation Agent that calculates project costs on the spot - we present
								your profile to agents and buyers at the exact moment of high intent. You only pay for highly qualified
								connections, reducing spam for the network and ensuring every lead you invest in is attached to a real property
								deal.
						</div>
						<div class="personaLinks">
							<a href="/docs/property-services/">Property Service Docs</a>
							<a href="/neighbourhood/">Area Guides</a>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class={`personaPanel ${persona === 'public' ? 'isActive' : ''}`} data-persona-panel="public">
							<div class="personaTitle">For Buyers &amp; Renters</div>
						<div class="personaSummary">
								PropertyList gives you the ultimate advantage: Total Market Transparency.
								<br />
